[I] A Text Encoding Conversion toolkit

[T] TECkit is a library for encoding conversion, usable through standalone
[T] tools or by linking with other software. Its mapping language describes
[T] conversions between legacy encodings and Unicode, and it is used by
[T] XeTeX.

[U] https://github.com/silnrsi/teckit

